# PX4 v1.14.3 EKF settings ONLY. Review in QGC; no motors/PID/RC failsafe bypasses.
# Apply with PX4 shell `param set NAME VALUE`, or set each value in QGC. This is
# a readable checklist, NOT a QGC .params import file and NOT automatically applied.
# Conservative single-EKF baseline with sensor voting. MAVLink diagnostics follow the primary EKF.
SENS_IMU_MODE 1
EKF2_MULTI_IMU 0
EKF2_GPS_CTRL 0
EKF2_EV_CTRL 15
EKF2_EV_DELAY 0
EKF2_EV_NOISE_MD 1
EKF2_EVP_NOISE 0.08
EKF2_EVV_NOISE 0.10
EKF2_EVA_NOISE 0.10
EKF2_EV_QMIN 0
EKF2_HGT_REF 3
EKF2_BARO_CTRL 0
EKF2_MAG_TYPE 5
EKF2_EV_POS_X 0
EKF2_EV_POS_Y 0
EKF2_EV_POS_Z 0
# EKF2_TAU/PID values remain the actual aircraft's tuned values.
# RC Position-mode navigation loss response (review/test native FC behavior):
COM_POSCTL_NAVL 1
# Do NOT copy SITL NAV_RCL_ACT=0, NAV_DLL_ACT=0, COM_RCL_EXCEPT=7, battery/circuit breakers.
